about the news?

00:16:09.501 --> 00:16:11.036
-It was.
I feel like I know --

00:16:11.036 --> 00:16:13.071
I feel like more --
I think the audience

00:16:13.071 --> 00:16:15.274
at home will feel
more enlightened, as well.

00:16:15.274 --> 00:16:17.609
-Yeah, and, I mean,
much like, you know --

00:16:17.609 --> 00:16:22.014
Like, it's nice to have
uninformed, uneducated people

00:16:22.014 --> 00:16:23.949
come by who don't
really know the news...

00:16:23.949 --> 00:16:25.384
-Yeah.
-...but have strong --

00:16:25.384 --> 00:16:27.118
-Well, I think,
yeah, for the people

00:16:27.118 --> 00:16:29.454
who are watching this
who don't live in New York,

00:16:29.454 --> 00:16:31.923
like, this is a lot
