and sharing their opinions.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:38.263
-Yeah, but you're usually
in the line at a deli.

00:16:38.263 --> 00:16:40.198
-Yeah.

00:16:40.198 --> 00:16:43.969
-And there might be somebody --
somebody on the floor asleep.

00:16:43.969 --> 00:16:45.403
-Yep.
-Too.

00:16:45.403 --> 00:16:46.972
-And then maybe one person
not wearing a mask

00:16:46.972 --> 00:16:48.940
and causing a bit of a hubbub.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:52.210
-Yeah.
And I'll tell you something.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:53.912
And I know this is
gonna be weird.

00:16:53.912 --> 00:16:56.181
But my For You Page on TikTok

00:16:56.181 --> 00:17:01.720
