on airplanes getting taped up.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.122
-Yeah.
Duct-taped on a plane.

00:17:03.122 --> 00:17:05.023
How do we feel about
duct-taped on a plane?

00:17:05.023 --> 00:17:07.526
-Okay.
And this is gonna be weird.

00:17:07.526 --> 00:17:10.696
I enjoy being squeezed
and compressed.

00:17:10.696 --> 00:17:12.297
I like it.
-Yeah.

00:17:12.297 --> 00:17:15.633
-So there is a part of me --
I do not want to say anything

00:17:15.633 --> 00:17:17.136
