get duct-taped.

00:17:17.136 --> 00:17:18.536
-Yeah.

00:17:18.536 --> 00:17:21.539
-But could I request
to be duct-taped?

00:17:21.539 --> 00:17:23.374
Because I would feel so good
in it,

00:17:23.374 --> 00:17:25.277
