00:17:25.277 --> 00:17:27.111
[ Laughter ]

00:17:27.111 --> 00:17:28.713
I would like the feeling.

00:17:28.713 --> 00:17:30.416
But I don't want
to have the behavior.

00:17:30.416 --> 00:17:32.050
So I'm hoping
there's gonna be a --

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:33.719
-I like the idea
that they would land

00:17:33.719 --> 00:17:35.720
and then, like, the cops
would run on the plane

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.989
and they'd see you,
and the stewardess would

00:17:37.989 --> 00:17:40.059
have to be like, "No, no, no!
She asked! It's him."

00:17:40.059 --> 00:17:41.626
-"She paid extra."
-"She paid extra."

00:17:41.626 --> 00:17:44.029
-I would love to get
a gentle duct taping

00:17:44.029 --> 00:17:46.165
with, like, a beautiful
duct tape.

00:17:46.165 --> 00:17:48.300
Like, that doesn't hurt
when it comes off.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:50.269
-Oh, right, right. Yeah, yeah.
-And a quiet duct tape.

00:17:50.269 --> 00:17:53.505
Like a lavender duct tape
that's wrapped...

00:17:53.505 --> 00:17:55.741
And they're like, "Don't bother
her. She's duct-taped."

00:17:55.741 --> 00:17:57.843
And I'm like, "I'm sorry.
I wish I could talk.

00:17:57.843 --> 00:18:00.578
But I'm duct-taped to the seat."

00:18:00.578 --> 00:18:03.047
But, no, that's not good.
That's not good.

00:18:03.047 --> 00:18:05.350
That's not good behavior.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.486
But, you know,
one man's treasure

00:18:07.486 --> 00:18:09.688
